[en.FOCUS_C14_GUESTS]
Reception of Guests

[en.FOCUS_C14_GUESTS_desc]
This family reunion is close to the Family Appreciation Day, thus “Cousin” Braeburn will be receiving guests from outside the Apple family at the meeting, discussing friendship and business, and paving the way for the future development of the Apple family.

[zh.FOCUS_C14_GUESTS]
接待宾客

[zh.FOCUS_C14_GUESTS_desc]
此次家族团聚临近家族感恩节，“表哥”布雷本将在会议上接待来自苹果家族以外的宾客，探讨友谊与生意，为苹果家族的未来发展铺路。

